# The program keypair is a SECRET, not a build artifact.
#
# Whoever holds it can deploy arbitrary code to our program address, including
# after we have deployed. It lives under target/ (ignored above) and must be
# backed up somewhere that is not this repository. Losing it means the program
# can never be upgraded again; leaking it means someone else can upgrade it.
#
# The public key is fine to commit, and is in .program-id and Anchor.toml.
*keypair.json
